# Top-level script PDFs may be copyrighted (the Jon Jory Pride & Prejudice
# adaptation) or carry edition restrictions (Folger CC-BY-NC) — keep these out.
# The curated PUBLIC-DOMAIN OCR corpus under sample-scripts/ocr-test-set/ IS
# committed (all pre-1929 editions). Sources: docs/ocr-test-set.md
sample-scripts/*.pdf
android/.kotlin/
.asr-eval/
